M220 S100 ;Reset Feedrate 
M221 S100 ;Reset Flowrate 
 
M140 S70 ;Set final bed temp  
G28 ;Home 
 
G92 E0 ;Reset Extruder 
G1 Z2.0 F3000 ;Move Z Axis up 
M104 S230 ;Set final nozzle temp  
G1 X-2.0 Y20 Z0.28 F5000.0 ;Move to start position 
M190 S70 ;Wait for bed temp to stabilize  
M109 S230 ;Wait for nozzle temp to stabilize  
G1 X-2.0 Y145.0 Z0.28 F1500.0 E15 ;Draw the first line 
G1 X-1.7 Y145.0 Z0.28 F5000.0 ;Move to side a little 
M73 P0 R830
G1 X-1.7 Y20 Z0.28 F1500.0 E30 ;Draw the second line 
G92 E0 ;Reset Extruder 
G1 E-1.0000 F1800 ;Retract a bit 
G1 Z2.0 F3000 ;Move Z Axis up 
G1 E0.0000 F1800
G90
G21
M83 ; use relative distances for extrusion
; filament start gcode
SET_PRESSURE_ADVANCE ADVANCE=0.08; Override pressure advance value
G1 E-.8 F1800
G1 Z.2 F18000
M106 S0
